msgid ""
"The pilot can manually switch between the source sets using a 3-position "
":ref:`auxiliary switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` configured for \"EKF "
"Pos Source\" (90).  When the switch is pulled low, the primary source set "
"will be used.  Middle position is for the secondary source set and High is "
"for the tiertiary source set.  If the transmitter's channel 8 switch is to "
"be used set:"
