"时，这些消息将显示在数据页面的消息选项卡中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:59
#: 1f69ac0c8d8a47c09e67ec49e937c5c7 4ee9db06d9884fe9968c9fdfdae4b5e4
#: 5453821ce29942648f7aff70bab0b663 8220e230cc584bb9a0e8c5d8cf6d6bc3
#: 8905a527d860433183ffe198aa383380 f7411638f37143398ee461ce6932c247
msgid ""
"After changing sources wait 10 seconds to confirm the EKF remains healthy. "
"If using Mission Planner the EKF label on the HUD should remain white"
msgstr "切换传感器源后等待 10 秒，确认 EKF 保持健康状态。使用 Mission Planner 时，HUD 上的 EKF 标签应保持白色。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:60
#: 0269ad62c5404834839a96ff3d1c332b 08e2212e4ac64c6f93c1f35f54d3b16a
#: 5359ec5d46234a9a8b8e30ae0998e5ef 836bbdcc91184f8f8ac8d3359ffe46bf
#: f23d5edcc47241808536c26c2e4ad961 fc7c604d631349279c3bc7b360cb32aa
msgid ""
"Check the vehicle's horizontal position, altitude and heading using the "
"ground station.  If using GPS with the :ref:`Intel Realsense T265 <common-"
"vio-tracking-camera>` you should notice a jump when switching from the T265 "
"to GPS but not when switching from GPS to T265.  This is because the "
"\"ExternalNav\" position is always updated to match the GPS when the GPS is "
"the primary source set"
msgstr ""
"通过地面站检查飞行器的水平位置、高度和航向。若将 GPS 与 :ref:`Intel Realsense T265 <common-vio-"
"tracking-camera>` 配合使用，从 T265 切换至 GPS 时应会注意到位置跳变，但从 GPS 切换至 T265 "
"时不应出现跳变。这是因为当 GPS 为主传感器源时，「ExternalNav」位置始终与 GPS 同步更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:62
#: 3852762088eb46849c5a58e5b9d658a3 63f71fdbabca4f48a42bdc8d41c8c03a
#: bc11cb75b4ff495588374117f37ce309 d13418fd0dad4d339fbb12bfca76be26
#: d36173df8ae1474590fae7e1ef3683b3 e7042cb8f67849ca9d448e8dfe226c6d
msgid ""
"Next perform a flight test in a safe environment, manually switching between"
" sources.  Be prepared to re-take control in a manual mode such as "
"Stabilize."
msgstr "接下来在安全环境中进行飞行测试，手动切换传感器源。请做好随时以手动模式（如 Stabilize）重新接管飞行的准备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:64
#: 01174fa2bd74414c821b750aa446e56d 02595880aed449e2b4e48d0605797622
#: 0db0359a480f43a3abd4724e5eaefae0 57cb6799c6a64659ad59fe755cedee7d
#: 582d1f93c469465db6d96238b3ddb426 5ad1c0c7c0e84bf1b5b3baec6cfdb67f
msgid ""
"If you plan to automatically switch sources, first walk the vehicle between "
"the GPS and Non-GPS environments to confirm it is switching source sets.  "
"Finally perform a flight test in which the vehicle is flown (or driven) at "
"low speeds between the two environments.  As with previous tests be ready to"
" re-take control in a manual mode such as Stabilize."
msgstr ""
"如果计划自动切换传感器源，首先让飞行器在 GPS 和非 GPS "
"区域之间缓慢移动，确认其正确切换传感器源组。最后进行飞行测试，以低速在两种环境之间飞行（或行驶）。与之前测试一样，随时准备以手动模式（如 "
"Stabilize）接管控制。"

